Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.28,0:00:02.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,what if every memecoin
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.56,0:00:03.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,trade actually helped
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.96,0:00:05.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,someone real?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.88,0:00:07.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,This is sow.fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:09.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,You pick a real borrower
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.38,0:00:10.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,on Kiva,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:11.75,Cap,,0,0,0,,like a weaver, a farmer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:12.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,or a baker,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.76,0:00:13.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,and you launch a coin
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.64,0:00:15.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,for them on Solana.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.07,0:00:17.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,Every trade has a small fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.67,0:00:20.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,45% of it is locked
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.31,0:00:23.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,to that person’s Kiva loan, forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.65,0:00:25.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,Another 45 goes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.13,0:00:26.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,to whoever launched the coin,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.97,0:00:28.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,and 10%
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.81,0:00:30.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,keeps the lights on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.14,0:00:31.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,And honestly,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.76,0:00:33.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,you don’t have to trust anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.18,0:00:36.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,The fees are claimed on-chain,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.14,0:00:37.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,sent to Kiva,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.26,0:00:38.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,and every single hop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:40.11,Cap,,0,0,0,,gets a public receipt
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.16,0:00:41.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,that you can check yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.50,0:00:43.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,Nothing’s hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.74,0:00:46.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,When that loan is fully funded,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.16,0:00:47.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,the coin doesn’t stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.64,0:00:48.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,It moves on to the next
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.90,0:00:50.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,borrower in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.50,0:00:52.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,So the leaderboard isn’t market cap,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.04,0:00:54.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,it’s lives lifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.92,0:00:57.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,Sow a coin, grow a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.66,0:00:58.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,sow.fun
